OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CBurnham defends inviting influencers   
OL,5,Cinto No 10 in PMQs row with Badenoch   
OL,6,GAndy Burnham has defended his use of   
OL,7,Gsocial media influencers to get the    
OL,8,Ggovernment's message across to young   
OL,9,Gpeople in angry exchanges with Kemi    
OL,10,GBadenoch at Prime Minister's Questions.
OL,12,FThe Conservative leader called on the  
OL,13,Fprime minister to apologise for        
OL,14,F"debasing his office" by allowing a    
OL,15,Fcontent creator to record a video on   
OL,16,Fthe steps of Number 10, which included 
OL,17,F"vile" and "obscene" comments about    
OL,18,Fwomen.                                 
OL,20,FBurnham said the video had been taken  
OL,21,Fdown and its creator had "rightly      
OL,22,Fapologised" for it.               G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
