OL,4,CNone of UK government's #2.5bn steel   
OL,5,Cpackage spent in Wales, figures show   
OL,6,GWales has not received any money from  
OL,7,Gthe UK government's #2.5bn steel       
OL,8,Gindustry investment plan announced in  
OL,9,GFebruary 2025, according to figures    
OL,10,Gobtained through a Freedom of          
OL,11,GInformation (FOI) request.             
OL,13,FThe UK's Department for Business,      
OL,14,FInnovation, Science and Trade          
OL,15,Fconfirmed that "the government has not 
OL,16,Fspent, nor allocated, nor committed    
OL,17,Fany money under the #2.5bn commitment  
OL,18,Fin Wales".                             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
